                    {
                        "form_id": "0d761880-6ef3-4ef3-b00c-548b7f69d11c",
                        "entry_id": "087fbea1-7889-37fe-870e-e916aaf601a4",
                        "tags": [],
                        "form": "post-prandial"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "410f0928-98be-3a82-9cc0-556aa994f74b",
                        "entry_id": "087fbea1-7889-37fe-870e-e916aaf601a4",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Qui concerne le moment qui suit le repas, qui se produit après le repas."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "e222b1c9-6c28-4b3e-a942-b06abdbad184",
                                "sense_id": "410f0928-98be-3a82-9cc0-556aa994f74b",
                                "text": "L’anorexie postprandiale : La satiété qui suit un repas."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "9dc27d76-b7b4-47a6-b5d2-a5cc564e0942",
                                "sense_id": "410f0928-98be-3a82-9cc0-556aa994f74b",
                                "text": "Le symptôme du coup de pompe après le repas est une véritable hantise pour tous les managers. Eh bien, il faut savoir que cette somnolence postprandiale, comme l’appellent les médecins, est le signe d’une hypoglycémie !"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "dcf1ff9e-294d-4da0-bab6-cabc5fe476dd",
                                "sense_id": "410f0928-98be-3a82-9cc0-556aa994f74b",
                                "text": "[…] ces mêmes souris développent une obésité sévère en rapport avec une diminution de la thermogenèse postprandiale."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "a8754f3e-62d4-4ec5-9bdb-d9d36b423a66",
                                "sense_id": "410f0928-98be-3a82-9cc0-556aa994f74b",
                                "text": "Un dessert de trop, un café en moins, une légère somnolence postprandiale ou une visite inopinée ont pu priver, de façon définitive, un terme de la nationalité française, en provoquant une distraction momentanée du compilateur."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "83d1c122-d493-4733-aae1-101a00b11959",
                                "sense_id": "410f0928-98be-3a82-9cc0-556aa994f74b",
                                "text": "Quand s'achevera leur marche postprandiale et qu’ils devront se séparer, l'un sera derrière les barreaux, dans une cellule dont l'autre possédera la clé."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "8e03e2eb-852a-467c-b3ba-aa3dbc528a02",
                        "source_entry_id": "087fbea1-7889-37fe-870e-e916aaf601a4",
                        "source_sense_id": "410f0928-98be-3a82-9cc0-556aa994f74b",
                        "target_lang_word": "postprandial",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "postprandial",
                                "target_lang_code": "de",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "92074ba0-f5d5-3673-938a-ab818bb603d5",
                                        "entry_id": "4d80ccd6-d772-354a-88fb-98cce85e0de3",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "nach dem Essen"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e19afb31-7365-4e08-a349-391ae91d8904",
                                                "sense_id": "92074ba0-f5d5-3673-938a-ab818bb603d5",
                                                "text": "Postprandial ist die Gallenblase klein."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6839c005-0c6c-4185-a96e-fa213f4f358f",
                                                "sense_id": "92074ba0-f5d5-3673-938a-ab818bb603d5",
                                                "text": "Postprandial kommt es zu einem Blutdruckabfall mit Herzfrequenzanstieg und einer vermehrten Insulinausschüttung."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7571f9a2-9eb1-4881-8113-4d7512eb438a",
                                                "sense_id": "92074ba0-f5d5-3673-938a-ab818bb603d5",
                                                "text": "Postprandiale Thermogenese - die mit der Nahrung aufgenommene Energie wird in Wärmeenergie umgewandelt. Daher das Gefühl des Aufheizens des Kreislaufs, beziehungsweise des Schwitzen nach dem Essen."
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "957e0bcc-16c8-4871-807b-9a6b5e818352",
                        "source_entry_id": "087fbea1-7889-37fe-870e-e916aaf601a4",
                        "source_sense_id": "410f0928-98be-3a82-9cc0-556aa994f74b",
                        "target_lang_word": "postprandial",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "postprandial",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "3371b828-77b5-330a-9e74-5a2352faf1ed",
                                        "entry_id": "cf2dfc26-235c-3b14-bbb1-f7092715fcc1",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "After a meal, especially after dinner."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "not-comparable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "70185ff1-d06e-4a6a-a413-bf89e97f5b37",
                                                "sense_id": "3371b828-77b5-330a-9e74-5a2352faf1ed",
                                                "text": "postprandial somnolence",
                                                "translation": "food coma",
                                                "english": "food coma"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "34ba188d-9188-412a-82f5-b83d31aede50",
                                                "sense_id": "3371b828-77b5-330a-9e74-5a2352faf1ed",
                                                "text": "As a post-prandial speaker, however, Thackeray was undeniably the reverse of felicitous."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a63c7257-1ec9-4555-a00d-e617b3707e37",
                                                "sense_id": "3371b828-77b5-330a-9e74-5a2352faf1ed",
                                                "text": "The Arch-Vicar is picking his teeth. There is a comfortable, postprandial silence."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b2c6c5eb-5470-4cb3-bf7f-0fd5e3974f48",
                                                "sense_id": "3371b828-77b5-330a-9e74-5a2352faf1ed",
                                                "text": "Patients who demonstrate significant insulin resistance at diagnosis and require insulin therapy may alternate preprandial and postprandial evaluations to enable more rapid optimization of control by using an additional supplemental insulin sliding scale as needed to cover preprandial hyperglycaemia (>100 ml per dl)[…]."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d7dc3755-2554-4f1a-a643-f60e9958aa65",
                                                "sense_id": "3371b828-77b5-330a-9e74-5a2352faf1ed",
                                                "text": "The standardized analysis of metabolic parameters in the preprandial and postprandial state may provide important functional clues for the diagnosis of metabolic disorders."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c829450e-1eab-4fdf-bdd9-fcda81070844",
                                                "sense_id": "3371b828-77b5-330a-9e74-5a2352faf1ed",
                                                "text": "Intimate, discreet and modestly quite proud of itself, it [the book] has the tone of the postprandial speech that Bannister gave at Pembroke College to 120 of his friends, looking over his life, like the portrait on the panelled walls of himself as Master."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3db3d612-dcd1-40ad-beab-e40caaec2168",
                                                "sense_id": "3371b828-77b5-330a-9e74-5a2352faf1ed",
                                                "text": "The slight increase in pre-prandial and post-prandial bile acids are suggestive of hepatic dysfunction, but other causes of slight elevations, such as pancreatic or gastrointestinal disease, cannot be ruled out."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "27a31959-74b2-4fde-8c68-97ef1b958dad",
                                                "sense_id": "3371b828-77b5-330a-9e74-5a2352faf1ed",
                                                "text": "But the most egregious transgression, at least in her opinion, is his postprandial habit of chomping and crunching on nuts."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
